*** Settings ***
Documentation       Business actions in the web shop - these keywords are used in tests.
...                 Example: demo shop saucedemo.com.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/{{ 'browser' if web_library == 'browser' else 'selenium' }}_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Start Browser
    [Documentation]    Starts the browser. Belongs in the test setup.
    Launch Browser

Stop Browser
    [Documentation]    Closes the browser. Belongs in the test teardown.
    Close All Web Browsers

Open Login Page
    [Documentation]    Opens the login page of the application.
    Go To Address    ${WEB_BASE_URL}

Log In
    [Documentation]    Logs in. Without arguments with the credentials of the active environment (main.resource).
    [Arguments]    ${user}=${LOGINS}[${ENV}][username]    ${password}=${LOGINS}[${ENV}][password]
    Fill Field    ${LOGIN_USERNAME_FIELD}    ${user}
    Fill Secret Field    ${LOGIN_PASSWORD_FIELD}    ${password}
    Click On    ${LOGIN_BUTTON}

Add Product To Cart
    [Documentation]    Adds a product to the cart, e.g. "sauce-labs-backpack".
    [Arguments]    ${product}
    ${button}    Build Selector    ${MAIN_ADD_TO_CART_BUTTON}    product=${product}
    Click On    ${button}

Open Cart
    [Documentation]    Opens the cart.
    Click On    ${MAIN_CART_LINK}

Log Out
    [Documentation]    Logs out via the menu.
    Click On    ${SETTINGS_MENU_BUTTON}
    Click On    ${SETTINGS_LOGOUT_LINK}
